Signed-off-by: chenyutao <chenyutao2@huawei.com>
(cherry picked from commit 6563db611e970904029c12c49c4dbf8347b8550c)
---
 src/urma/lib/urma/bond/bondp_api.c          | 24 ++++++---
 src/urma/lib/urma/bond/bondp_bitmap.c       |  2 -
